        <CheatEntry>
          <ID>82782</ID>
          <Description>"Party Formation"</Description>
          <Options moHideChildren="1"/>
          <DropDownList DisplayValueAsItem="1">0:Empty
1:Jude
2:Milla
3:Alvin
4:Elize
5:Rowen
6:Leia
7:Gaius
8:Muzét
9:Ludger
</DropDownList>
          <ShowAsSigned>0</ShowAsSigned>
          <GroupHeader>1</GroupHeader>
          <Address>regionCheckEquip-204</Address>
          <CheatEntries>
            <CheatEntry>
              <ID>82783</ID>
              <Description>"READ THIS"</Description>
              <Color>0000FF</Color>
              <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
              <AssemblerScript>/*
Adding party members while the menu is open will crash the game-
If using multiple of the same character, stats are shared between them.
Attempting to linking to the same character (e.g. Jude -&gt; Jude) will crash the game
Changing weapons on Ludger changes every Ludger's weapon in the party.

Tip: Ludger requires to be in the party to get calls from Vera.

Tip: Against Chronos' Time Compression, you can use the "Chromatus Activate/Deactivate"
(Arte ID is 1280) arte on any character, you do not need Ludger against him.
However, be careful, as you need to stay stationary when activating the arte,
otherwise you softlock the game.
(you may fix it by giving yourself the "Death" Status Effect, however)

Tip: If coming out of a battle and you have a black screen, but the game didn't
crash, you can recover by making the party entirely different characters.
*/
[ENABLE]
[DISABLE]
</AssemblerScript>
            </CheatEntry>
            <CheatEntry>
