          <CheatEntries>
            <CheatEntry>
              <ID>84016</ID>
              <Description>"READ THIS"</Description>
              <Color>0000FF</Color>
              <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
              <AssemblerScript>/*
"World Map version" lets you unlock fast traveling by the World Map, however
note that this might break the game and make you softlocked by bypassing
cutscene triggers and such.

It also does really weird stuff with the map (actual and the map you can bring up
with []) if you change the second column, first number, e.g. like disabling enemies, disabling
load zones and the like. It can even disable voices.
Oh, and the second column, second number also changes Milla's voice.
*/
[ENABLE]
[DISABLE]
</AssemblerScript>
