              <AssemblerScript>/*
"Arte/Skill unlocks" are permanent unlocks.
Note that character-related skills might not work properly on other characters, and as such, they have a chance
     of freezing that character. (you can use a linked arte with a different character to fix them, though)

"Fill the whole World Map" is permanent.

"Allow debt to be paid off in one go" still requires that you have enough Gald.
Do not pay the last 100 gald until you have access to the Land of Canaan,
or your world might get softlocked.
*/
[ENABLE]
[DISABLE]
</AssemblerScript>
